# Membership (RAOS Ch.1–2 + AI Credits Runtime)

Full docs: `docs/raos/chapter-01-*.md`, `chapter-02-*.md`.
Credits Runtime: `src/lib/credits/`.

## Positioning

- Free = AI Travel Assistant (complete planning, no long-term intelligence).
- Plus = AI Travel Companion (Memory, DNA, History, Workspace, Insights, Optimizer personalization, proactive learning).
- Same AI stack; Plus adds Intelligence Layer.

## Free may use

Chat, place/food/stay/transport recommendations, create/edit full itineraries, map, favorites, place detail, weather, outfit tips.

## Plus-only (permission-gated)

Conversation Workspace / History, Travel Memory, Travel DNA, Preference Learning, Planner Optimizer personalization, AI Insights, History Engine, long-term context, proactive recommendations, Memory/DNA snapshots, conversation resume.

## Credits (product policy — Runtime)

- Monthly credits (natural month, no rollover). Free: **20**/month.
- Only two billable features:
  - `PLACE_RECOMMENDATION` = **1** credit per successful recommendation **batch** (not per place / card / Places API call).
  - `ITINERARY_GENERATION` = **7** credits for one full itinerary success (ask → combo → planner → persist → favorites).
- Manual trip edits (favorites / detail) = **0** credits.
- Flow: Check → Reserve → Execute → Commit; failure → Rollback.
- Plus: skip Check / Reserve / Commit; keep Fair Use / rate limit / provider protection.
- Cancel Plus: remain Plus until end of current billing period, then Free + 20 credits.
- Enforce via Supabase RPCs (`credit_accounts` / `credit_ledger`); client must not mutate balances.
- Feature flag: `VITE_FEATURE_CREDITS_ENABLED` (dev/test ON; production public OFF until verified).
- Home must not show remaining credits; chat Greeting uses stages 15–20 / 8–14 / 1–7 / 0.
- Debug: `credit_debug_overrides` only — Runtime prefers Override over formal balances; never mutate formal `available_credits` for QA.
- Subscription Debug: Auto (real sub) / Force Free / Force Plus.
- Stale `reserved` ledger rows auto-rollback after 5 minutes.
- Ledger `environment`: `debug` | `production`.
